  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will focus on the piloting of a community-level mediation programme, intended to divert minor cases away from the formal justice sector. The project will involve drafting of relevant legislation, development of standard operating procedures, training and capacity building and the piloting of community mediations.</narrative>
